{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為慶祝中華人民共和國成立77周年，國慶煙花匯演10月1日晚上八時在維港上空舉行，歷時約23分鐘，合共發放逾三萬枚煙花。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FK94VnoeSv1790857953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_006.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202602OnBsL5521790858032.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_006.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">匯演分為八幕，其中，首幕「喜迎國慶頌山河」，以金色錦冠煙花配上綠、藍禮花彈，勾勒巍峨山脈與奔流江河，展現中華大地的磅礡氣象；第二幕「驕陽送暖」以金、紅光環層層綻放出的太陽花圖案，象徵希望與堅定信念。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，第四幕「有夢飛航」的七彩變幻球與游星圖案營造宇宙景象，寓意港人勇於追夢。至於壓軸「旭陽高照慶華年」，大量紅、金煙花如朝陽綻放，祝願國家繁榮昌盛、香港光耀向前。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_010.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nbbSjbXUxZ1790857967.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_010.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_007.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bJI0TzugNL1790857986.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_007.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_005.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026l955qNcbYU1790857998.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_008.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CX81Hp0hM51790858014.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE.FIREWORK 2000_008.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T13:20:25.234911+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}